llama_content:
{
  "translated_term": "Dijigitalne Umetnosti",
  "translation_rationale": "Prevedeno je prema definiciji Digital Humanities kao interdisciplinarnog polja koje koristi digitalne tehnologije za istraživanje i analizu kulturnih i umetničkih tekstova."
}

{
"translated_term": "Makala ya Kielektroniki",
"translation_rationale": "Kwa kuwa Digital Humanities ni neno linalotokana na Kiingereza, tunahitaji kubadilisha maana yake katika lugha ya Lango (Uganda). Makala ya Kielektroniki ina maana kwamba utafiti wa kisayansi unaojikita katika teknolojia za kielektroniki. Katika Lango, tunaweza kuibua neno hili kwa kutumia maneno mawili: 'Makala' (yaani, utafiti) na 'Kielektroniki' (yaani, teknolojia ya kompyuta). Kwa hiyo, tuna 'Makala ya Kielektroniki'."
}

```
{
  "translated_term": "數位人文學",
  "translation_rationale": "將英文\"Digital Humanities\"翻譯為中文,根據慣例,將\"digital\"翻譯為\"數位\", \"humanities\"翻譯為\"人文學\"。"
}
```

```
{
  "translated_term": "\u5e26\u7a97\u4f1a\u6d77",
  "translation_rationale": "\"Digital Humanities\" 的翻译是基于 \"数字人文\" 这个概念。数字人文是一门研究使用数字技术和方法来理解、分析和呈现人类文化遗产的学科。"
}
```

```
{
  "translated_term": "Digitaik Humänitäs",
  "translation_rationale": "Volapük uses a combination of Latin and Germanic roots to create new words. 'Digital' is translated as 'digitaik', which combines the Latin root 'digit-' (finger) with the suffix '-aik' (relating to). 'Humanities' is translated as 'Humänitäs', which combines the Latin root 'human-' with the suffix '-itäs' (relating to or belonging to)."
}
```

{
"translated_term": "Dijital Adabiyot",
"translation_rationale": "The term \"Digital Humanities\" is a direct translation of the English phrase. In Uyghur, \"dijital\" means digital or computer-related, and \"adabiyot\" refers to literature or humanities."
}

{
  "translated_term": "Tamɣaḍawt n Tamezwarut",
  "translation_rationale": "The term 'Digital Humanities' is translated into Central Atlas Tamazight by combining two words: 'Tamɣaḍawt', which means 'digital' or 'computer-related', and 'n Tamezwarut', which means 'humanities'. The word 'Tamezwarut' is derived from the Arabic word 'adab', meaning 'culture' or 'civilization'."
}

```
{
  "translated_term": "Humanis Digital",
  "translation_rationale": "Dipilih istilah yang paling dekat dengan bahasa Indonesia, yaitu 'Digital' dan 'Humanis'. Istilah ini umum digunakan dalam konteks akademik dan penelitian."
}
```

{
  "translated_term": "Digidal Humaniti",
  "translation_rationale": "In Sranan Tongo, the language uses a combination of English and indigenous words. 'Digital' is translated as 'digidal', which is commonly used in the language to refer to digital technology. 'Humanities' is translated as 'humaniti', which reflects the academic discipline's focus on human culture and society."
}

JSON:

{"translated_term": "Dijigitalne humanistike", 
"translation_rationale": "Prevedeno iz engleskog 'Digital Humanities' u srpsko-hrvatski jezik, uzimajući u obzir njegovu etimologiju i značenje. Izraz se sastoji od dvije riječi: 'digitalni', koji označava sve što je vezano za računarske tehnologije, i 'humanistike', koja označava nauku o ljudskoj kulturi, društvenim normama i umjetnosti. Prevedeno u srpsko-hrvatski jezik, izraz 'Dijitalne humanistike' isto tako podrazumijeva kombinaciju računarske tehnologije i ljudske kulture."}

```
{
